WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.520
- Before we say goodbye we
like to play a quick roundup!

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.683
- Drewth or Dare.

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:07.010
(audience applauding)

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:09.190
- We do anything, we say anything.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:13.437
And we have Sheralynn
Stratton here. Sheralynn?

00:00:13.437 --> 00:00:14.750
- Hi.
- Hi.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:15.970
- Did I say your name correctly?

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:16.840
- [Sheralynn] Yes, you did.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:17.673
- Oh, thank God.

00:00:17.673 --> 00:00:19.330
- Thank God. And thank
God you wore that pink.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.490
Look how great that is.
- Fuchsia.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:24.750
- Fuchsia? Oh, fuchsia, oh, I.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.304
Oh!

00:00:26.304 --> 00:00:28.700
- [Drew] We have a lipstick that color.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.130
- I love that fuchsia dress.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:31.970
- Thank you.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:32.810
- You're welcome.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:34.170
All right, what's it gonna be?

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:35.700
Is it gonna be a Drewth or a dare?

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.940
- I have a Drewth.

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.080
- [Ross] Okay.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:42.070
- So Drew, have you ever
gone skinny dipping?

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.646
And if so, what's your story?

00:00:44.646 --> 00:00:46.191
- I mean, which time?

00:00:46.191 --> 00:00:47.950
(audience and Ross laughing)

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:49.860
A hotel pool at the-
- What?

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.750
- Chateau Marmont in Los Angeles,

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.303
for, I don't know, about 15 years.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:59.300
And a great, like midnight jump

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.190
in the lake of Winnipesaukee,
in New Hampshire.

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:04.763
My favorite lake in the world, I think.

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:11.220
And I will say birthday
suit or bathing suit,

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:15.540
if you see a body of water or
rain coming down from the sky,

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:16.954
just get in it.

00:01:16.954 --> 00:01:19.042
- Oh, yeah.
(audience applauds)

00:01:19.042 --> 00:01:21.090
- You'll never regret it.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.440
You will always dry off pretty quickly.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:29.440
And you will be immediately
transformed in a nature baptism,

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:32.630
and I just can't recommend it enough.

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:35.330
Recently my girls and I
actually got to go somewhere,

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:38.670
which was such a blessing
and it started pouring rain,

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:41.670
and we were at a beach and we ran outside

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:45.850
and we took a rain
shower and an ocean bath.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:49.870
And we even brought out
some shampoo and conditioner

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:53.787
and really did, and we like
bathed in the ocean, and then-

00:01:53.787 --> 00:01:54.840
- What?
- Yes!

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.870
Rain shower, ocean bath.

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:59.500
And it's one of my favorite moments

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.320
in the filmstrip of my life.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:05.020
It made, it was the greatest moment ever.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.850
I did have clothes on, however.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:07.930
- Okay. Good, good.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.630
- Have you ever skinny dipped Ross?

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.680
- Thanks so much for watching everybody.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.110
(audience laughs)

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.230
Yeah.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.340
- Where? When?

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:19.510
- My house, my house, my
house. Never in public.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:21.480
Oh God no, never in, dear God, no.

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:25.673
But yeah, you know, my pool,
my house, gates locked.

00:02:26.772 --> 00:02:29.855
(bright theme music)

